 traded under the card's stop; nothing after it counts as a breakout. Back under = the latest closed bar closed under the trigger. No breakout yet = a 🧠 potential: no bar has traded over its trigger. (Cheetah default, not his.) GG: “The volume will dry up during the entries of all my setups and it picks up if the setup works.” UNMEASURED."><strong>⏸ no breakout yet</strong> · last close 4.05 (-63.0% vs the trigger 10.95) · 0 min since first seen (10:15 bar)</div><ul class="gg-criteria" data-testid="gg-criteria"><li class="gg-ok">✓ K2 volume building on the run up — 2 big green bars (inside the run up each bar at least the volume of the bar before and no more than 5× it)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K3 volume dried up on the pullback — busiest bar 80,000 (every bar must be ≤ 125,000: half the average bar of the run up)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K4 short pullback — 4 bars (1 to 5 bars)</li></ul><div class="gg-chip-row" data-testid="gg-chip-row"><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">Float 1.0M</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">🔄 float ×9.0</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">+50.0%</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">vol 9.0M (min_av)</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">listed day 1/3 · since 2026-10-13</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">4 red closes in a row — he waits (“more than 3 red closes is red flag to me”)</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">flag #1 today · Business Insider: he plays the first and second, usually skips the third (one third-party source)</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">RTH</span></div><div class="gg-pot-tile" data-testid="gg-pot-tile"><span class="gg-pot-kind gg-pot-kind-armed" data-testid="gg-pot-kind">🧠 trigger armed · 🚩 Bull Flag · first seen 10:31 ET</span><span class="gg-pot-tells" data-testid="gg-pot-tells"><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted" data-tell="float" title="S8 21:04 “the lower the float the better”">Float 1.0M</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted" data-tell="rotation" title="S8 1:15:24 “the float is rotating”">🔄 float ×9.0</span></span></div><div class="gg-stages" data-testid="gg-stages-EEE" title="The setups this stock passed through on his list, oldest first. Today's steps show the 5-minute pass time (ET) that first saw them; earlier sessions show the date only. A setup shows here once it was a 🧠 potential or its 🎯 A+ alert rang — today's and the last session's full path are on the 🧠 Potential sub's 📈 Track." aria-label="today: 🚩 Bull Flag · 🧠 potential 10:31"><span class="gg-stages-title">🧭 Setup stages</span><span class="gg-stage-day" data-testid="gg-stage-day-EEE-2026-10-13">today</span><span class="cm-badge gg-stage gg-stage-here" data-testid="gg-stage-EEE-2026-10-13-bull_flag">🚩 Bull Flag · 🧠 potential 10:31</span></div></div><button type="button" class="gg-broker-toggle" data-testid="gg-broker-toggle-EEE" aria-pressed="false" title="🚫 not eligible at Fidelity" aria-label="🚫 not eligible at Fidelity">🚫</button></div><div data-testid="gg-tile-DDD" class="gg-card gg-wide"><div class="cm-tile-chips" data-testid="gg-chips-DDD"><span></span> <span></span> <span></span></div><div class="cm-tile cm-tile-openview" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Open DDD — 15, 5 and 1-minute charts (⤢)" data-testid="cm-openview-DDD"><div class="cm-tile-head"><div class="cm-tile-id"><b>DDD</b><div class="cm-tile-ident"></div></div><div class="cm-tile-actions"><a class="cm-sepa-link" data-testid="cm-sepa-link-DDD" aria-label="Open DDD on the SEPA page" title="Open DDD on the SEPA page" href="/sepa/DDD?tab=supply&amp;tf=5m_today&amp;from=chart-maps&amp;from_q=tab%3Dgajjala%26sub%3Dpotential">SEPA page</a><button type="button" class="cm-tv cm-watch" data-testid="watch-DDD" title="Add DDD to Signals (your watchlist)" aria-label="Add DDD to Signals" aria-pressed="false">+ Signals</button><button type="button" class="cm-tv" title="Open DDD on Yahoo Finance" aria-label="Open DDD on Yahoo Finance">Yahoo ↗</button></div></div><svg viewBox="0 0 620 