" data-testid="gg-state">forming — ready: the next bar over 6.25 · UNMEASURED</span><span class="gg-vol-dried" data-testid="gg-vol-dried-DDD">💧 volume dried up</span></div><div class="gg-plan" data-testid="gg-plan">Entry above 6.25 · stop 6.09 · risk 2.5%</div><div class="cm-note gg-line gg-brk gg-brk-no_break_yet" data-testid="gg-brk-DDD" title="Display only — no alert, A+, rule, order or grade reads it. Trigger bar = the bar that broke the trigger (the card's own A+ / triggered / broke bar). Breakout = a later closed bar closing above the highest high since the trigger bar; the latest closed bar decides the line, an earlier breakout is named in the detail. Volume louder = that bar's volume above the busiest bar of the base (the card's K3 row). Traded under the stop = a bar from the trigger bar on traded under the card's stop; nothing after it counts as a breakout. Back under = the latest closed bar closed under the trigger. No breakout yet = a 🧠 potential: no bar has traded over its trigger. (Cheetah default, not his.) GG: “The volume will dry up during the entries of all my setups and it picks up if the setup works.” UNMEASURED."><strong>⏸ no breakout yet</strong> · last close 4.05 (-35.2% vs the trigger 6.25) · 325 min since first seen (05:05 bar)</div><ul class="gg-criteria" data-testid="gg-criteria"><li class="gg-ok">✓ tennis ball action — drop 2026-10-13 04:50 · back 2026-10-13 04:55 (a drop of 8% or more that closed back within 2% of the high on the drop bar or in the next 3 bars)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ tried the highs earlier and got sold — 1 failed try today (within 2% of the day's high then 8% under that try's high: a separate sell-off that ends before the tennis ball)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K3 volume dried up in the base — busiest bar 60,000 (every bar must be ≤ 200,000: half the average bar of the run back up)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ quiet base — 2 bars (at least 1 bar)</li></ul><div class="gg-chip-row" data-testid="gg-chip-row"><span class="cm-badge 