34" y="281" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--text-muted, #7c869b)" text-anchor="middle">16:00</text></svg><div class="cm-rungs"><div class="cm-rung cm-rung-setup"><span class="cm-rung-tag">SETUP</span><div class="cm-rung-items"><div class="cm-kv"><span class="cm-stat"><span class="cm-stat-k">Change</span><span class="cm-stat-v">+50.0%</span></span><span class="cm-stat"><span class="cm-stat-k">Volume</span><span class="cm-stat-v">9.0M</span></span></div></div></div><div class="cm-rung cm-rung-plan"><span class="cm-rung-tag">PLAN</span><div class="cm-rung-items"><div class="cm-kv"><span class="cm-stat"><span class="cm-stat-k">Entry</span><span class="cm-stat-v">10.97</span></span><span class="cm-stat"><span class="cm-stat-k">Stop</span><span class="cm-stat-v">10.81</span></span><span class="cm-stat"><span class="cm-stat-k">Last</span><span class="cm-stat-v">4.05</span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gg-extras" data-testid="gg-extras"><div class="gg-pills"><span class="gg-state gg-state-forming" data-testid="gg-state">forming — ready: the next bar over 10.97 · UNMEASURED</span><span class="gg-vol-dried" data-testid="gg-vol-dried-AAA">💧 volume dried up</span></div><div class="gg-plan" data-testid="gg-plan">Entry above 10.97 · stop 10.81 · risk 1.4%</div><div class="cm-note gg-line gg-brk gg-brk-no_break_yet" data-testid="gg-brk-AAA" title="Display only — no alert, A+, rule, order or grade reads it. Trigger bar = the bar that broke the trigger (the card's own A+ / triggered / broke bar). Breakout = a later closed bar closing above the highest high since the trigger bar; the latest closed bar decides the line, an earlier breakout is named in the detail. Volume louder = that bar's volume above the busiest bar of the base (the card's K3 row). Traded under the stop = a bar from the trigger bar on traded under the card's stop; nothing after it counts as a breakout. Back under = the latest closed bar closed under the trigger. No breakout yet = a 🧠 potential: no bar has traded over its trigger. (Cheetah default, not his.) GG: “The volume will dry up during the entries of all my setups and it picks up if the setup works.” UNMEASURED."><strong>⏸ no breakout yet</strong> · last close 4.05 (-63.1% vs the trigger 10.97) · 0 min since first seen (10:05 bar)</div><ul class="gg-criteria" data-testid="gg-criteria"><li class="gg-ok">✓ K2 volume building on the run up — 2 big green bars (inside the run up each bar at least the volume of the bar before and no more than 5× it)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K3 volume dried up on the pullback — busiest bar 100,000 (every bar must be ≤ 125,000: half the average bar of the run up)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K4 short pullback — 2 bars (1 to 5 bars)</li></ul><div class="gg-chip-row" data-testid="gg-chip-row"><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">Float 5.0M</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">🔄 float ×1.8</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">+50.0%</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">vol 9.0M (min_av)</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">listed day 1/3 · since 2026-10-12</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">flag #1 today · Business Insider: he plays the first and second, usually skips the third (one third-party source)</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">RTH</span></div><div class="gg-pot-tile" data-testid="gg-pot-tile"><span class="gg-pot-kind gg-pot-kind-armed" data-testid="gg-pot-kind">🧠 trigger armed · 🚩 Bull Flag · first seen 09:21 ET</span><span class="gg-pot-tells" data-testid="gg-pot-tells"><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted" data-tell="float" title="S8 21:04 “the lower the float the better”">Float 5.0M</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted" data-tell="rotation" title="S8 1:15:24 “the float is rotating”">🔄 float ×1.8</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted" data-tell="ah_mover" title="S8 13:21–14:34 “after hours moves from the past day, I'll keep them as well”">🌙 after-hours mover last session +14.0%</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted" data-tell="prior_day" title="S9 2:02:47 “previous-day strength”">📅 on his scanner 2026-10-12, up to +85%</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted" data-tell="also" title="S9 1:59:01 “two or three setups mixed together … the certainty of the move is higher”">🧩 also forming: 💋 EMA Kiss &amp; Fly</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted" data-tell="again" title="S9 1:17:32 “it will stay a couple of days, make noise a couple of days”">↻ also a potential last session</span></span></div><div class="gg-stages" data-testid="gg-stages-AAA" title="The setups this stock passed through on his list, oldest first. Today's steps show the 5-minute pass time (ET) that first saw them; earlier sessions show the date only. A setup shows here once it was a 🧠 potential or its 🎯 A+ alert rang — today's and the last session's full path are on the 🧠 Potential sub's 📈 Track." aria-label="Mon 10-12: 🚩 Bull Flag · 🧠 potential · stopped → today: 🚩 Bull Flag · 🧠 potential 09:21 → 💋 EMA Kiss &amp; Fly · 🧠 potential 09:21"><span class="gg-stages-title">🧭 Setup stages</span><span class="gg-stage-day" data-testid="gg-stage-day-AAA-2026-10-12">Mon 10-12</span><span class="cm-badge gg-stage" data-testid="gg-stage-AAA-2026-10-12-bull_flag">🚩 Bull Flag · 🧠 potential · stopped</span><span class="gg-stage-sep" aria-hidden="true"> → </span><span class="gg-stage-day" data-testid="gg-stage-day-AAA-2026-10-13">today</span><span class="cm-badge gg-stage gg-stage-here" data-testid="gg-stage-AAA-2026-10-13-bull_flag">🚩 Bull Flag · 🧠 potential 09:21</span><span class="gg-stage-sep" aria-hidden="true"> → </span><span class="cm-badge gg-stage" data-testid="gg-stage-AAA-2026-10-13-kiss_fly">💋 EMA Kiss &amp; Fly · 🧠 potential 09:21</span></div></div><button type="button" class="gg-broker-toggle" data-testid="gg-broker-toggle-AAA" aria-pressed="false" title="🚫 not eligible at Fidelity" aria-label="🚫 not eligible at Fidelity">🚫</button></div><div data-testid="gg-tile-JJJ" class="gg-card"><div class="cm-tile-chips"