t, A+, rule, order or grade reads it. Trigger bar = the bar that broke the trigger (the card's own A+ / triggered / broke bar). Breakout = a later closed bar closing above the highest high since the trigger bar; the latest closed bar decides the line, an earlier breakout is named in the detail. Volume louder = that bar's volume above the busiest bar of the base (the card's K3 row). Traded under the stop = a bar from the trigger bar on traded under the card's stop; nothing after it counts as a breakout. Back under = the latest closed bar closed under the trigger. No breakout yet = a 🧠 potential: no bar has traded over its trigger. (Cheetah default, not his.) GG: “The volume will dry up during the entries of all my setups and it picks up if the setup works.” UNMEASURED."><strong>⏸ no breakout yet</strong> · last close 4.05 (-63.0% vs the trigger 10.94) · 0 min since first seen (10:20 bar)</div><ul class="gg-criteria" data-testid="gg-criteria"><li class="gg-miss">✗ K4 sideways base length — 5 bars (6 to 24 bars)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K3 volume dried up in the base — busiest bar 100,000 (every bar must be ≤ 125,000: half the average bar of the run up)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K6 tight base — 1.4% from high to low (at most 8% of the price)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K6 9 and 21 EMA merged — EMAs 0.14% apart (at most 0.5% apart)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K6 selling drying up — second half 50% of the first half's volume (under 70%)</li></ul><div class="gg-chip-row" data-testid="gg-chip-row"><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">Float 8.0M</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">🔄 float ×1.1</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">+50.0%</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">vol 9.0M (min_av)</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">listed day 1/3 · since 2026-10-13</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">RTH</span></div><div class="gg-pot-tile" data-testid="gg-pot-tile"><span class="gg-pot-kind gg-pot-kind-building" data-testid="gg-pot-kind">🧠 building · ➖