stat"><span class="cm-stat-k">Entry</span><span class="cm-stat-v">10.48</span></span><span class="cm-stat"><span class="cm-stat-k">Stop</span><span class="cm-stat-v">10.42</span></span><span class="cm-stat"><span class="cm-stat-k">Last</span><span class="cm-stat-v">4.05</span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gg-extras" data-testid="gg-extras"><div class="gg-pills"><span class="gg-state gg-state-forming" data-testid="gg-state">forming — low 0.6% above the 9 EMA — waiting for the kiss · UNMEASURED</span><span class="gg-vol-dried" data-testid="gg-vol-dried-HHH">💧 volume dried up</span></div><div class="gg-plan" data-testid="gg-plan">trigger 10.48 · stop 10.42 · risk 0.6%</div><div class="cm-note gg-line gg-brk gg-brk-no_break_yet" data-testid="gg-brk-HHH" title="Display only — no alert, A+, rule, order or grade reads it. Trigger bar = the bar that broke the trigger (the card's own A+ / triggered / broke bar). Breakout = a later closed bar closing above the highest high since the trigger bar; the latest closed bar decides the line, an earlier breakout is named in the detail. Volume louder = that bar's volume above the busiest bar of the base (the card's K3 row). Traded under the stop = a bar from the trigger bar on traded under the card's stop; nothing after it counts as a breakout. Back under = the latest closed bar closed under the trigger. No breakout yet = a 🧠 potential: no bar has traded over its trigger. (Cheetah default, not his.) GG: “The volume will dry up during the entries of all my setups and it picks up if the setup works.” UNMEASURED."><strong>⏸ no breakout yet</strong> · last close 4.05 (-61.4% vs the trigger 10.48)</div><ul class="gg-criteria" data-testid="gg-criteria"><li class="gg-ok">✓ K2 volume building on the run up — 1 big green bar (inside the run up each bar at least the volume of the bar before and no more than 5× it)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K3 volume dried up on the pullback — busiest bar 100,000 (every bar must be ≤ 150,000: half the average bar of the run up)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K5 uptrend — 9 EMA 10.36 · 21 EMA 9.56 (9 EMA above the 21 EMA and both higher than 3 bars ago)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K4 short pullback — 3 bars (at most 9 bars)</li><li class="gg-ok">✓ K5a pullback honors the 9 EMA — 3 pullback bars (every pullback bar closes at or above the 9 EMA)</li><li class="gg-miss">✗ K5 pullback touched the 9 EMA (the kiss) — low 0.6% above the 9 EMA (a low no more than 0.5% above the 9 EMA and a close above it)</li></ul><div class="gg-chip-row" data-testid="gg-chip-row"><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">float unknown</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">+50.0%</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">vol 9.0M (min_av)</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">listed day 1/3 · since 2026-10-13</span><span class="cm-badge cm-badge-muted">RTH</span></div><div class="gg-pot-tile" data-testid="gg-pot-tile"><span class="gg-pot-kind gg-pot-kind-building" data-testid="gg-pot-kind">🧠 building · 💋 EMA Kiss &amp; Fly</span></div></div><button type="button" class="gg-broker-toggle" data-testid="gg-broker-toggle-HHH" aria-pressed="false" title="🚫 not eligible at Fidelity" aria-label="🚫 not eligible at Fidelity">🚫</button></div></div>"`;

